## The problem

The accounts payable team kept paper payment vouchers in storage and tracked who borrowed them by hand.

## What I built

A web app where staff scan a voucher to check it in or out. Colleagues request a voucher through an online form, and the app sends email confirmations automatically, so the team always knows where each document is.
